      "publish_at": null,
      "meta_title": "Your Competitor Isn’t Winning With a Better Product — It’s Better Systems | Regent",
      "meta_description": "Discover why businesses don’t lose because of weaker products, but because of weaker systems. Learn how structured processes drive consistent growth and scalable success.",
